Package: ensIDHistory
Type: Package
Title: Ensembl Stable ID History and Cross-Release Mapping
Version: 0.99.0
Authors@R: c(
    person(
        "Lachlan", "Baer",
        email = "baerlachlan@gmail.com",
        role = c("aut", "cre"),
        comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-5213-3401")
    )
  )
Description: Tools to query Ensembl stable ID history using the
    public Ensembl MySQL server or the Ensembl REST Archive API.
    Provides functions to retrieve the mapping history of Ensembl
    gene, transcript, and protein identifiers between releases,
    identify retired IDs, and update IDs to a target release.
